# Public keys that verify MonitorFlow Enterprise license keys (ADR-0100):
# Ed25519, in PEM (SubjectPublicKeyInfo), as `openssl pkey -pubout` writes
# them. Never the release signing key. The server is built with every key
# in this file and accepts a license signed by any of them, which allows a
# rotation. The private key stays on the owner's machine:
# scripts/license-keypair.sh makes the pair and prints the block to add
# here; scripts/license-sign.sh signs licenses with it.
#
# No key yet: until one is added, this build accepts no license.
